{
  "id": "ep41-vo-08",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "S1n",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "三千年前，人最想说话的对象，是天。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S1n.mp3",
      "bytes": 66498,
      "heard": "三千年前,人最想说话的对象是天。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.08
    },
    {
      "name": "S3n",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "火烤龟甲，裂纹，就是天的回答。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S3n.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "火烤归家,列文就是天的回答。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "S4n",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人和天的这场对话，刻在龟甲上，留到了今天。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "S4n.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "人和天的这场对话刻在硅甲上留到了今天",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "G1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这张金唱片，是写给外星人的一封信。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "G1.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "这张金唱片是写给外星人的一封信",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "G2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "没人知道，会不会有谁听见。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "G2.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "沒人知道會不會有誰聽見",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "G3",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可人类，还是把它寄了出去。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "G3.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "可人类还是把它寄了出去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "N4",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人类发明的每一种通讯，都是因为有人，想跟够不着的人，说一句话。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N4.mp3",
      "bytes": 98263,
      "heard": "人类发明的每一种通讯都是因为有人想跟够不着的人说一句话",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 6.08
    },
    {
      "name": "N4b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人类发明的每一种通讯，都是因为有人，想跟够不着的人，说一句话。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N4b.mp3",
      "bytes": 99517,
      "heard": "人类发明的每一种通讯都是因为有人想跟够不着的人说一句话",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 6.16
    },
    {
      "name": "N5",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "现在，这句话，只要一秒钟。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "N5.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "现在这句话只要一秒钟",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "MOM0",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "喂？这么晚了，还没睡啊？",
